WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.829
Identify benefits of communication technology and how to use it politely.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.975
Telephones and other communication tools help people contact one another over

00:00:10.975 --> 00:00:16.250
distances. The curriculum highlights faster contact, lower travel needs and easier

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:16.729
communication.

00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:22.483
Handle devices carefully, keep them out of excessive heat and follow adult guidance.

00:00:22.483 --> 00:00:27.432
Speak politely on phone calls, introduce yourself and listen to the other person.

00:00:28.283 --> 00:00:32.806
Role-play making and receiving a polite call; demonstrate safe device care.
